<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space">                </span>&lt;h1 class="display-3 fw-bold mb-4"&gt;</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space">                    </span>Earlier insight.&lt;br&gt;</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space">                    </span>Better preparedness.</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space">                </span>&lt;/h1&gt;</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space">                </span>&lt;p class="lead mb-4"&gt;</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space">                    </span>Explore flood, glacial-lake, and debris-flow hazard information</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space">                    </span>across Nepal through satellite observations, weather context,</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space">                    </span>and practical preparedness resources.</span></p>
<p class="p1"><span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space">                </span>&lt;/p&gt;</span></p>
